MID_LGV_1LED_c03_Buc_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1LED_c03_Buc_m01_001: I don't think I've been here since I brought you to the\ntemple as your guardian.
MID_LGV_1LED_c03_Buc_m01_002: <NCA>Agree with him.
MID_LGV_1LED_c03_Buc_m01_003: <NCB>Ask him what's wrong.
MID_LGV_1LED_c03_Buc_m01_004: <ACA>People and their towns burn to the ground\nand disappear...
MID_LGV_1LED_c03_Buc_m01_005: <ACA>while this place alone stays forever unchanged.\nOr perhaps that's just an illusion.
MID_LGV_1LED_c03_Buc_m01_006: <ACB>Even the Demon Bear is not immune to\nsentimentality.
MID_LGV_1LED_c03_Buc_m01_007: <ACB>Does seeing this place not stir up certain feelings\nin you too, milady?
MID_LGA_1LED_c03_Buc_m01: <BLN>What a strange feeling.
MID_LGV_1LED_c03_Sci_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1LED_c03_Sci_m01_001: I'm always given to the strongest sense of ease here!\nIt was my home since I was a babe.
MID_LGV_1LED_c03_Sci_m01_002: But enough about me. You seem to be familiar with\nthe atmosphere of this space.
MID_LGA_1LED_c03_Sci_m01: <BLN>It puts me at ease.
MID_LGV_1LED_c03_Moo_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1LED_c03_Moo_m01_001: Whoaaa. I've never once in my life been to a temple!
MID_LGV_1LED_c03_Moo_m01_002: It's so fancy. And so pretty! If you asked me to\nimagine the place a god lived, I'd picture...well, this!
MID_LGV_1LED_c03_Moo_m01_003: Smells really nice too. It smells kinda like you.
MID_LGA_1LED_c03_Moo_m01: <BLN>So pretty!
MID_LGV_1LED_c03_B01_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1LED_c03_B01_m01_001: Welcome, traveler! This is the temple of Kalla,\nthe Patron-Huntress.
MID_LGV_1LED_c03_B01_m01_002: You'll be pleased to know the lady is present today.
MID_LGV_1LED_c03_B01_m01_003: If you intend to offer your greetings, please do refrain\nfrom any miscreance.
MID_LGA_1LED_c03_B01_m01: <BLN>Welcome to Kalla's temple.
MID_LGV_1LED_c03_B02_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1LED_c03_B02_m01_001: Dear me. I can't help but shake the sense that I've\nseen your face before.
MID_LGV_1LED_c03_B02_m01_002: Aren't you Leilidahna, the youngest woman ever\nnamed Rose of Caelus?
MID_LGV_1LED_c03_B02_m01_003: No... That's not possible. Didn't she die in the Siege\nof Cydonia?
MID_LGA_1LED_c03_B02_m01: <BLN>Dear me...
MID_LGV_1LED_c03_B03_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1LED_c03_B03_m01_001: I'm sure I just saw Syracusio.
MID_LGV_1LED_c03_B03_m01_002: The man who left without a word! Sent me not even\none scrap of a letter while he's been away...
MID_LGV_1LED_c03_B03_m01_003: I don't care how important the mission Kalla gave\nhim was. That's not fair!
MID_LGA_1LED_c03_B03_m01: <BLN>The callousness of it!
MID_LGV_1LED_c03_B04_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1LED_c03_B04_m01_001: I've been asked to prepare fragrant oils for Kalla\nto apply after her bath.
MID_LGV_1LED_c03_B04_m01_002: But, ah... There are so many of them, from all\nover Dagda! I have no idea which to use.
MID_LGV_1LED_c03_B04_m01_003: Oh, I know! I'll ask Olympia for help.
MID_LGV_1LED_c03_B04_m01_004: She will know which oils are best suited for the lady's\nmood today.
MID_LGA_1LED_c03_B04_m01: <BLN>What ever do I do?
MID_LGV_1LED_c03_B05_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1LED_c03_B05_m01_001: My grandson is dead set on participating in the\nRose Pageant this year.
MID_LGV_1LED_c03_B05_m01_002: He has skill—really, he does!—but I'm not sure if he's\nat the temple's level.
MID_LGV_1LED_c03_B05_m01_003: Just as long as he doesn't end up embarrassing\nhimself in front of Kalla...
MID_LGA_1LED_c03_B05_m01: <BLN>I worry.
MID_LGV_1LED_c03_B06_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1LED_c03_B06_m01_001: The paragons of every artistic endeavor, from art\nto music to literature, all find their way here.
MID_LGV_1LED_c03_B06_m01_002: In these walls they find fresh inspiration and the\nimpetus to create something new.
MID_LGV_1LED_c03_B06_m01_003: It's no stretch to say this temple has proven vital to\nour continent's cultural development.
MID_LGA_1LED_c03_B06_m01: <BLN>Did you know?
MID_LGV_1LED_c03_B07_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1LED_c03_B07_m01_001: I heard something from a merchant who visited.
MID_LGV_1LED_c03_B07_m01_002: There was an uprising in the Aragonian territory of\nKassite. The viceroy was killed.
MID_LGV_1LED_c03_B07_m01_003: Now, Arago is preparing troops to put the\nrebellion down.
MID_LGV_1LED_c03_B07_m01_004: Does that region really need more bloodshed?
MID_LGA_1LED_c03_B07_m01: <BLN>It's a tragedy.